#basePath Chapter10

::OnContractSelectOpenCh10
@trigger OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene 
@once 
//saying goodbye to Arken 
{@Arken}    Hey, don't look so grim, buddy.
{@Player}   It's just a lot to get my head around. I've known Dorian for a long time.

{@Player}   I was really hoping to talk to Keela.
{@Player}   I feel like... if we could talk things out, like we used to...
{@Player}	...I could make sense of all this.
{@Player}   Man, I miss the good old days.
{@Arken}    Back when Dorian Greyson was still Dorian Black?

//end call



::BeforeSupplyChainCh10
@trigger 	OnOverarhcing 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Quinn}    Hey, Cowboy! I gotta 'nother hauler for ya.
{@Player}   Great. I could use some good news.
{@Quinn}    Well... it's fully automated.
{@Quinn}    And ...it's slow.
{@Player}   Of course it is.

//spreading hazards causing delays from more inspections
{@Quinn}    You'll need it to cut down on bottlenecks. Frontier's stopping ships along so many of routes now.
{@Quinn}	They're lookin' for pirates and outlaws.
{@Player}   I bet I know who they are looking for! 
{@Quinn}    Good luck finding her.
{@Player}	Tell me about it. 



::AfterSupplyChainCh10
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene 
@once
//reminder of money due threat and now its coming from dorian. 
{@MAL}      ©-Captæin! Y0u h@ve a l-l€tter f¿om... Fr0ntier Robotic§!
{@Player}   Of course I do. Let's see...

{@Player}      "Captain Locke Sawyer: This is a reminder that your final payment deadline for the Constantine is approaching."
{@Player}      "Failure to meet your financial obligation by the specified date will result in repossession of the vessel by Frontier Robotics."
{@Player}      "We appreciate your continued partnership!"
{@Player}	Partnership? Yeah, right.

::DisposalFee10
@trigger    OnGoalCompleted
@when       goalId == "Goal1"
@cutscene
@once
{@Player}   PAID IN FULL! That's the last of the upgrade fees.
{@Player}   I'm broke, <i>again</i>, but at least I own my ship, free and clear.
$call ActivateGoal("Goal2")
{@Player}   ...
{@Player}   YOU HAVE <b>GOT</b>...
{@Player}   TO BE <b>KIDDING</b> ME.
{@Player}   "Unauthorized disposal of company property?" They're charging me for those robots!
{@Player}   "Per Section 14, Subsection C, any additional fees or penalties incurred under the original agreement shall be added to the outstanding debt..."
{@Player}   "...and remain secured against the Constantine until paid in full."
{@Player}   So until I pay this, Frontier can still take my ship?!